  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »wearCheck« </h3> <h2> Analysis of Tool Wear Using Artificial Intelligence </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Analyzing Wear and Tear Integrated into Production – ZOLLER Shows How AI Drives Progress!</strong></p> <p>The AI-based »wearCheck« measurement function supports standardized and automated assessment of tool condition using image processing techniques. The software provides a reliable analysis during tool preparation—without any additional time investment!</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/03_Media_Press/Downloads/Automation/ZOLLER_Flyer_KI_wearCheck_FLWEARCHECK_00_DE_02.pdf\">»wearCheck« Brochure</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/c/csm_wearCheck_07f0151f53.webp",
     "alt": "",
